Files from the MS-DOS v4.0 sources Microsoft published under the MIT License
(LICENSE here): https://github.com/microsoft/MS-DOS, commit
2d04cacc5322951f187bb17e017c12920ac8ebe2, directory v4.0. They are unchanged
apart from line endings (LF).

  ALLOC.ASM, FAT.ASM          src/DOS/                arena and FAT algorithms (kernel/)
  MSINIT.ASM                  src/BIOS/               DiskTable2 BPBs (FORMAT, kernel/dos.c)
  MSFOR.ASM                   src/CMD/FORMAT/         the volume serial number
  CHKPROC.ASM                 src/CMD/CHKDSK/         CHKDSK's repairs
  MKCNTRY.ASM, MKCNTRY.INC    src/DEV/COUNTRY/        COUNTRY.SYS data (tools/mkcountry.py)
  COPYRIGH.INC                src/INC/
  USA-MS.MSG                  src/MESSAGES/           the utilities' message texts
  *.SKL, FDISK.MSG            src/CMD/<utility>/, src/DEV/ANSI/
  keyboard/KDF*.ASM, KEYBOARD.LNK, KEYBMAC.INC, KEYBSHAR.INC
                              src/DEV/KEYBOARD/       KEYBOARD.SYS (tools/mkkeyboard.py)
  keyboard/POSTEQU.INC        src/INC/

Sources in the tree that translate these or other v4.0 files, or quote their
messages, are marked "GPL-2.0-or-later AND MIT" and carry Microsoft's notice.
